# journey_mine (kenshi-k16.19.1; docs/reference/PLAYTEST.md 1). The Wanderer beside the Hub's nearest copper deposit (the one the navmesh reaches, 1.8 km south-west of the Bar). The
# step is the mine order (right-click the deposit), then the take (drag the ore out of the deposit's window). Only the player is ordered.
