scenario title=Mine%20the%20Hub%27s%20copper setup=The%20Wanderer%20stands%20about%2060%20u%20from%20the%20copper%20deposit%20south-west%20of%20the%20Hub%20%28the%20Copper%20Resource%20below%20the%20west%20gate%29%2C%20alone. look_for=Right-click%20the%20deposit%20%28the%20cursor%20over%20it%20should%20be%20the%20pickaxe%2C%200x12%20mine%29%20and%20send%20the%20Wanderer%20to%20mine%20it.%20Is%20the%20pickaxe%20cursor%27s%20hover%20area%20as%20large%20as%20the%20original%27s%3A%20it%20should%20show%20over%20the%20node%27s%20own%20rock%20mesh%20and%20nowhere%20beyond%20it%2C%20and%20also%20when%20you%20come%20up%20to%20it%20from%20the%20Hub%20gate%20%28mine1%20in%20kenshi-inspect%20findings%2FINDEX.md%2C%20mining_node_pick.md%29%3F%20Does%20the%20Wanderer%20walk%20up%2C%20swing%20the%20pick%20%28the%20stonemine%20clip%2C%20no%20progress%20bar%3A%20item59%2Fmining_no_progress_bar.jpg%29%2C%20and%20after%20about%20three%20minutes%20of%20game%20time%20at%20speed%201%20does%20one%20Copper%20appear%20in%20the%20deposit%27s%20output%20window%20%283x2%2C%20holds%205%29%3F%20Take%20it%20into%20the%20Wanderer%27s%20pack%3A%20the%20Copper%20should%20be%20in%20the%20inventory.%20The%20deposit%20does%20not%20run%20out.%20At%205%20ore%20the%20miner%20stops.%20The%20original%3A%20item59_mine_sell.md%20MQ1%20to%20MQ4%20and%20MQ9%2C%20operate_anim.md%2C%20ui_captures%2Fclient_mine_copper_taken.png.%20player_downed_s%20should%20stay%20unreported. bead=kenshi-k16.19 metrics=player_downed_s
